<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Hello everyone,

This macro is for AA (Auto Attack) spots in DMW.



. Simple macro


. Delay intervals between 380 and 600 ms (to make it seem more human-like)


. Runs for an average of 90 minutes, then pauses for a while before resuming (to avoid suspicious behavior)



Feel free to adjust the timings to your preference, since not all Digimon AA farm in the exact same way.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 42 72 ms
